msgid "Education"
msgstr "Oideachas"

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/candidate.py:135
#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:113
#, draft
msgid "Job-related"
msgstr "Scileanna a bhaineann leis an bpost"

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:502
#, draft
msgid "Languages"
msgstr "Teangacha"

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/candidate.py:131
#, draft
msgid "Management and leadership"
msgstr "Bainistíocht agus ceannaireacht"

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/candidate.py:122
#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:111
#, draft
msgid "Organisational"
msgstr "Scileanna eagrúcháin"

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:114
#, draft
msgid "Other"
msgstr "Scileanna eile"

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:763
#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:770
#, draft
msgid "Skills"
msgstr "Scileanna"

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/candidate.py:583
#, python-format, draft
msgid ""
"Some sections of the file have nowhere to go in Postulo yet and were not read: %(sections)s."
msgstr ""
"Níl aon áit ag roinnt rannán den chomhad i Postulo go fóill agus níor léadh iad: %(sections)s."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:653
#, draft
msgid "That does not look like a Europass file: it has no LearnerInfo section."
msgstr "Ní cosúil gur comhad Europass é seo: níl aon rannán LearnerInfo ann."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:637
#, python-format, draft
msgid "That file is not readable JSON: %(reason)s"
msgstr "Ní JSON inléite é an comhad seo: %(reason)s"

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:344
#, python-format, draft
msgid "That file is not readable XML: %(reason)s"
msgstr "Ní XML inléite é an comhad seo: %(reason)s"

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:634
#, draft
msgid "That file is not UTF-8, so it is not a Europass export."
msgstr "Níl an comhad seo in UTF-8, mar sin ní easpórtáil Europass é."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:642
#, python-format, draft
msgid "That file nests more than %(limit)s levels deep, so it was not read."
msgstr ""
"Tá an comhad seo neadaithe níos doimhne ná %(limit)s leibhéal, mar sin níor léadh é."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:181
#, draft
msgid ""
"That is not a Europass file. Postulo reads the PDF europass.europa.eu gives you, the XML attached to it, and the older Europass XML and JSON; this is none of them."
msgstr ""
"Ní comhad Europass é sin. Léann Postulo an PDF a thugann europass.europa.eu duit, an XML atá ceangailte leis, agus an XML agus JSON Europass níos sine; níl ann aon cheann acu."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:240
#, draft
msgid ""
"That PDF has files attached to it, and none of them is a Europass CV. Upload the PDF europass.europa.eu gives you, as it is."
msgstr ""
"Tá comhaid ceangailte leis an PDF sin, agus ní CV Europass aon cheann acu. Uaslódáil an PDF a thugann europass.europa.eu duit, mar atá sé."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:230
#, draft
msgid ""
"That PDF has nothing attached to it, so there is no Europass CV inside it to read. The PDF europass.europa.eu gives you carries the CV as an attached file, and a PDF printed or saved again by another program loses it: download the CV again from europass.europa.eu and upload that file as it is."
msgstr ""
"Níl aon rud ceangailte leis an PDF sin, mar sin níl aon CV Europass istigh ann le léamh. Iompraíonn an PDF a thugann europass.europa.eu duit an CV mar chomhad ceangailte, agus cailleann PDF a phriontáiltear nó a shábháiltear arís ag clár eile é: íoslódáil an CV arís ó europass.europa.eu agus uaslódáil an comhad sin mar atá sé."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:194
#, draft
msgid ""
"That PDF is encrypted, so the Europass CV attached to it cannot be read. Download the CV again from europass.europa.eu and upload that file as it is."
msgstr ""
"Tá an PDF sin criptithe, mar sin ní féidir an CV Europass atá ceangailte leis a léamh. Íoslódáil an CV arís ó europass.europa.eu agus uaslódáil an comhad sin mar atá sé."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:358
#, draft
msgid ""
"That XML is not a Europass CV. Postulo reads the XML europass.europa.eu writes (a Candidate) and that of the Europass editor before it (a SkillsPassport); this is neither."
msgstr ""
"Ní CV Europass é an XML sin. Léann Postulo an XML a scríobhann europass.europa.eu (Candidate) agus an XML d’eagarthóir Europass roimhe (SkillsPassport); níl ann ceachtar acu."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/__init__.py:40
#, draft
msgid ""
"The European CV format: the PDF europass.europa.eu gives you and the XML attached to it, and the older XML and JSON of the Europass service before it."
msgstr ""
"An fhormáid Eorpach CV: an PDF a thugann europass.europa.eu duit agus an XML atá ceangailte leis, agus XML agus JSON níos sine sheirbhís Europass roimhe."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:203
#, draft
msgid ""
"The file attached to that PDF is damaged and could not be unpacked. Download the CV again from europass.europa.eu and upload that file as it is."
msgstr ""
"Tá an comhad atá ceangailte leis an PDF sin damáistithe agus níorbh fhéidir é a oscailt. Íoslódáil an CV arís ó europass.europa.eu agus uaslódáil an comhad sin mar atá sé."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:198
#, python-format, draft
msgid ""
"The file attached to that PDF is packed in a way Postulo does not read (%(filter)s). Download the CV again from europass.europa.eu and upload that file as it is."
msgstr ""
"Tá an comhad atá ceangailte leis an PDF sin pacáilte ar bhealach nach léann Postulo (%(filter)s). Íoslódáil an CV arís ó europass.europa.eu agus uaslódáil an comhad sin mar atá sé."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:207
#, python-format, draft
msgid ""
"The file attached to that PDF unpacks to more than %(limit)s MB, so it was not read."
msgstr ""
"Osclaíonn an comhad atá ceangailte leis an PDF sin go níos mó ná %(limit)s MB, mar sin níor léadh é."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/candidate.py:188
#, draft
msgid ""
"The file holds this career in more than one language, and only the first was read."
msgstr ""
"Coinníonn an comhad an ghairm seo i níos mó ná teanga amháin, agus níor léadh ach an chéad cheann."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:446
#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py:716
#, draft
msgid "Work experience"
msgstr "Taithí oibre"
